  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be really useful if we could use the system clipboard inside of udon for copy paste of data/links/strings.\nFor example by using:\nUnityEngine.GUIUtility.systemCopyBuffer\nor\nUnityEditor.EditorGUIUtility.systemCopyBuffer\nor\nUnityEngine.TextEditor.copy()\nUnityEngine.TextEditor.paste()\nIt could be used for so much time saving functions in worlds, that would empower world makers and simplify things for users/players.\nAnd this could potentially be implemented for Quest users as well.",
